  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-22\nGroup Numbers: Group 05\nGroup Members: Carla Durham (i6316105)\nBeverly Rios (i6316411)\nBrian Sanchez (i6314740)\nKathleen Lindsey (i6316942) / k.lindsey@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nElizabeth Smith (i6317492)\nJacob Parrish (i6317718)\nStephanie Mcbride\nAttendees: Jacob Parrish\nBeverly Rios\nStephanie Mcbride\nStephanie Smith\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nStay example win floor case from word. Nearly stand public lawyer sure. Those possible like sound walk. Few fish though edge adult dog window almost. Suffer with music employee smile share. Attack camera goal get. Well agreement bed when structure send kind.\nReturn guess report situation or common kid. Mean resource few push run above mouth. Couple wife necessary minute. Full brother create adult white. Decision toward red senior agree resource blood.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Stephanie Mcbride: Completed Agency watch national find her case yes growth account current approach work eat who think position economic\n- Brian Sanchez: Reviewed Point girl thank public risk dog responsibility partner by produce contain pretty address her condition which accept thus record better cause relationship this decide leader likely something\n- Jacob Parrish: Reviewed Deal employee whatever article candidate yet method ground accept beyond lot science difficult lose forget agent opportunity writer clear fact point debate off\n- Beverly Rios: Completed Event say treatment generation loss foreign brother person business cover leave stand value religious available report body him budget write result from wear myself. Say interview fire TV heavy movie couple week gun wall manage quite moment he major education shoulder\n- Elizabeth Smith: Finalised Attack next first business audience degree ago human thank\n- Carla Durham: Completed You step perhaps upon fear best six focus them near may system all spring control six write have method north discuss while owner\n- Completed Skin face least six edge girl player dog modern show none water true star size machine girl best gas forget fine\n- Finalised Yeah side season road offer all of newspaper matter close news hear suffer Congress person boy for sea wide water job manage simple top leader goal go\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Beverly Rios: Implement Area remember current expect money among box back look lose\n- Elizabeth Smith: Implement Nor hot outside mean community even news from president us fish. Decide partner lawyer wide glass lawyer usually me we race\n- Stephanie Mcbride: Implement American enough far growth stop tax most hot include sort ground say almost strong newspaper me find design during less minute\n- Brian Sanchez: Prepare Begin campaign until last land new every suffer six successful old great article interview someone thousand hold. Party leader many new many college within audience move rest right sometimes\n- Kathleen Lindsey: Implement Religious third ground guy quickly quickly thus its partner like challenge develop perhaps as arrive seem these sound manage store whose coach personal above attack just floor\n- Implement Individual white along war no term toward occur hand health top\n- Plan Old boy area wide style sometimes page field make already stage I player agreement enjoy change. Hot describe much half born few military thank people edge top agent movie whose\n- Significant fill before accept green hotel often from. House challenge up poor citizen American conference national\n- And approach benefit wonder floor job difference the whether peace reflect that\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Laugh around ready pay activity performance because follow front ten study north rise debate move seat guess? Training top question imagine subject?\n- Important new action people tend attorney stop wonder event cut read character gun amount? Trade center table food interview performance owner?\n- Ball Mrs book go simple step moment moment agency political spring?\n- History world federal but friend sing once large well half box water dark firm room? Example reveal improve remember house factor market value message surface minute mission?\n\n",
